\section{Introduction}\label{sec:intro}

A paragraph with \emph{emphasis}, \textbf{bold text}, a literal dash -- and a tie~here,
a footnote\footnote{A note with \(a+b\).}, a user macro \(\Hs\) and \pair{a}{b}.
Some \verbtext+verbatim \text+ and a link \href{https://example.com}{to a page},
see \ref{sec:intro} and \eqref{eq:sum}, with $x = y$ in dollars. %% a comment
A remark \phf{marked}\phf[check this].

\begin{equation}\label{eq:sum}
  a + b = c
\end{equation}

